 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published. Starting cards are marked '(s)'/'(normal s)': Visage Of The Emperor, Prepared Defenses, Oppressive Enforcement and Imperial Arrest Order normally, Twi'lek Advisor and Broken Concentration against Mind What You Have Learned; several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "The post says it is a revision of the author's 'Foo on tracking Hunt Down' (post 9213): the Tatooine sites are replaced by Hoth sites and Epic Duel / Target The Main Generator are added.",
  "Posted 'You Are Beaten Sniper' is one line (the Interrupts (14) header counts it once, and Sniper is listed separately); dested You Are Beaten. 'Hoth Deffensive Perimeter X2' dested Hoth: Defensive Perimeter (3rd Marker) x2 as published (a unique site). 'Omni Box' dested Ommni Box; 'Hutt Smootch' Hutt Smooch; 'Fett w/blaster' Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; '4-LOM w/gun' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'AT AT cannon' AT-AT Cannon. Hoth sites are the Dark side's site pages.",
  "Oppressive Enforcement is the Special Edition Effect (no Defensive Shields in August 2000).",
  "Page title cleaned to 'They Can't Track' (archive dropped the apostrophe: 'They Can t Track')."
